#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:214
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Before you're able to interact with any of the Iron Watch fleet, you're contacted by a New Dawn ship hidden inside a nearby asteroid field.\n"
"\n"
"\"Excellent, you made it here and the Iron Watch don't suspect a thing. As you may remember, this sector is home to that neutron star your sensor may detect in the distance. The Iron Watch didn't establish the research base here, instead this sector was incorporated as the Neutron Star Exclusion Zone when the original scientists joined the Iron Watch.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:218
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:220
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Their work here has resulted in many new technologies, you may have "
"noticed that many of the Iron Watch shields are equipped with shielding "
"designed to protect them from the radiation of the neutron star. This is "
"what we're after, we've managed to steal or loot many copies of the "
"shielding device from Iron Watch ships, but its not enough to equip more "
"than our intelligence operatives, we need the schematics and designs for the"
" technology.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:222
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:224
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"This is where you come in, we believe that the schematics for this "
"technology are contained on original research station in orbit around the "
"neutron star. Our intelligence operatives have prepared their ship for a "
"raid on the station, but with the rebel fleet on the way they've stepped up "
"the protection around the facility. We need you to provide the distraction "
"that lets our intelligence operatives get close enough to the facility to "
"initiate the raid.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:226
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Agree to the mission."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:228
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Excellent, I'll upload the location of the research base, not that it's "
"hard to find being in orbit of the Neutron Star. Our operatives will be "
"ready to move in once you distract the guards, good luck.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:230
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:234
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:240
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Refuse the mission."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:242
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Well the raid is happening regardless of your participation, I'll upload "
"the location of the research base, not that it's hard to find. If you show "
"up, we'll assume you're onboard.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:244
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_START_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

