"You arrive face to face with Midnight Sun ship. Sleek and armed to the "
"teeth, this is sure to be a tough fight. You're given no chance to avoid the"
" fight as you're immediately within range of their weapons."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:451
