#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:566
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESEARCH_STATION\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"The last of the station's armed personal fall, dead. You return to your ship"
" and await communication from the Midnight Sun."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:571
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESEARCH_STATION\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:578
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The research station hangs in orbit above the neutron star, close enough that the radiation in unavoidable, you'll want to avoid spending too long here.\n"
"\n"
"The station appears well defended, with a few turrets and weapons mounted, additionally it appears to be protected from the radiation by some sort of strange shield, mostly purple but burning bright blue where the radiation is strongest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:583
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:585
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Not a moment later your comms crackle with an incoming signal. The signal is a tight-beam, encrypted, you're sensors aren't able to locate it's source.\n"
"\n"
"\"So you're who they sent, I hope you're good enough. But enough with the pleasantries...\" A ship uncloaks itself almost on top of you, the source of the signal, painted almost entirely black, the only source of colour a tiny golden sun insignia near the cockpit."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:589
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:591
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"...We're New Dawn Intelligence, or the Midnight Sun as some may know us. We will be raiding the station, but we require you to provide the distraction so that we may slip close enough to secure our prize, the Synchrotron Schematics.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"When you attack, disable their defences if you can, but it is vitally important that you do not destroy the station. To ensure an efficient mission we'll be sending over one of our own crew to oversee your side of the operation.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:595
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:598
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Midnight Sun Operative arrives via short range teleporter. After a quick inspection of your ship they take position in the piloting room to oversee the attack.\n"
"\n"
"It's not more than a few moments later that the operative receives an encrypted message, they turn to you, \"We're ready to go Captain, we'll move on your mark.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:604
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//triggeredEvent[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN_MISSION\"]/triggeredEventBox/tooltip"
msgstr ""
"Survive in combat with the station until this time, ensure the station is "
"not destroyed!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:610
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_DAWN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Begin the attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:622
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_FAILED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We're severely disappointed in you Captain. Do not contact us again.\" "
"With that the Midnight Sun retrieve their crew and jump away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:624
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_FAILED\"]/choice[@req=\"human_og_midnight\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:626
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_FAILED\"]/choice[@req=\"human_og_midnight\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/text"
msgstr "Perhaps you should have been more careful to not destroy the station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:634
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_FAILED\"]/choice[@req=\"human_og_midnight\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:641
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_DAWN_RESEARCH_SYNCHROTRON\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr ""
"One of the turrets is launched off into empty space as the ship explodes, "
"throwing valuable debris in every direction."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:644
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_DAWN_RESEARCH_SYNCHROTRON\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:649
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_DAWN_RESEARCH_SYNCHROTRON\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You will regret this! Karma always comes back to people like you. Damn you"
" Renegades... the New Dawn will...\" They die before they can finish this "
"last remark."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:652
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_DAWN_RESEARCH_SYNCHROTRON\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:658
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_DAWN_BARRIER_GET\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Amongst the remains of the ship you find, intact, the Synchrotron Barrier. "
"After consulting scans of the device you're able to install it on your own "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:665
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your sensors detect the Midnight Sun ship disengage from the station, it quickly retreats to safety, it appears that your job here is done. You begin disengaging from the station yourself.\n"
"\n"
"The Midnight Sun operative rushes over to you, \"What are you doing Captain? I haven't received the signal, we shouldn't disengage yet.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:669
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Show them that the Midnight Sun ship has already disengaged to safety."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:671
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"But then why hav-\" They cut off, you cannot see their face beneath the "
"helmet, but their body language gives you the impression that something that"
" something is very wrong. They appear to be interacting with some sort of "
"internal system within their armour."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:673
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:675
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Midnight Sun vessel begins charging it's jump drive, \"We hoped that the"
" station would do the job for us, you unfortunately exceeded our "
"expectations Captain. Good bye.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:678
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:681
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Not a moment later a new ship uncloaks, this one a more traditional New Dawn vessel. One of your crew turn to you, \"Captain, that ship, they're refusing our hails, scans indicate they're bringing their weapons online.\"\n"
"\n"
"The operative has gone very still beside you. When they finally speak, their voice is quiet. \"This wasn't apart of any briefing I received.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:685
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:687
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The operative turns to face you, now slightly slumped, apparently given up on whatever they were trying to do before.\n"
"\"I was told this was a clean extraction. Get in, coordinate, get out. That we would deal with you later, whether that was buying your silence, or silencing you ourselves I do not know. Apparently there were other plans, plans I wasn't aware of. I should have known it wouldn't be this simple.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:690
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:692
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"I know where the Midnight Sun ship will have gone. There's a small Midnight Sun outpost nearby, that's where they'll be offloading the barriers and schematic. If you desire revenge, as I do, that's where we'll need to go.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'd like to join your crew officially, it's clear that the Midnight Sun is done with me, and you're my best bet for revenge.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:698
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_RESEARCH_STATION_WON\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Prepare for combat."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:719
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Midnight Sun captain lets out one final expletive as the ship is "
"obliterated."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:720
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"The hull of the Iron Watch vessel is dispersed out into space. You swoop in "
"to salvage the remains."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:721
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch ship explodes, extinguishing all lives within. Your crew "
"avoids their remains as they salvage the ship pieces."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:722
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"One of the turrets is launched off into empty space as the ship explodes, "
"throwing valuable debris in every direction."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:730
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"\"Your bloodlust... will be your downfall someday, Renegade. You are only "
"proof... the Federation... is no better than the Rebellion...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:731
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Without a word, the Iron Watch captain falls to the ground, gasping for air "
"as the life is extinguished from their eyes. You salvage the hull of their "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:732
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"\"You will regret this! Karma always comes back to people like you. Damn you"
" Renegades...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:738
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"SURRENDER_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept their surrender."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:747
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_MIDNIGHT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"\"Alright, you win! Here's some equipment from our stores. Leave us alone!\""

