msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_SCIENTIST_OUTCOME_DETECTION\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You identify the cause of the malfunction, the satellite had been bugged. It"
" appears to be a very high tech operation, they left almost no trace, but "
"you managed to recover some deleted data, a snapshot of a dark stealth ship "
"flying away from the satellite, you can make out only a faint gold insignia "
"on the side, but nothing more. \"Wow! Thanks for the help, we'll be sure to "
"bring this up the chain of command, you can have all the supplies we can "
"spare, thanks.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:1442
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_SCIENTIST_OUTCOME_REPAIR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You manage to identify the cause of the malfunction, it appears the "
"satellite had been bugged, someone had tried to covertly disable the "
"satellite, unfortunately there isn't a trace of who did it. \"Wow, great "
"work, here I insist you take these supplies as a thank you for the help, "
"we'll make sure to look out for more bugs like that in the future, or until "
"the culprit is found.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:1446
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_SCIENTIST_OUTCOME_REPAIR_PARTIAL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You identify a few faults, but nothing related to the malfunction. \"I "
"appreciate the help, even if we still don't appear to be any closer to a "
"solution, take some supplies as a thank you for your time.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:1450
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_NEUTRON_SCIENTIST_OUTCOME_NOHELP\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"I appreciate the attempt, but this clearly isn't going anywhere.\" They "
"politely but forcefully go back to repairing it themselves."

