msgstr ""
"\"We got caught in that big star's beam, the newton star or whatever they "
"call it, really screwed us up, but we have something worth your while a "
"genuwine piece of New Dawn technology! We couldn't work out how to use it "
"ourselves, but I'm sure its valuable, it's the reason we got stuck out here "
"after all.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_neutron.xml:1547
